Z||000001||Monkeyman||10-14-2001||08:21 AM||||The fastbacks were the '86-'88 GTs only, although there were other cars with the aero front and rear fascias ('84 Indy, '86 & '87 SEs as well as all of the GTs from '85 through '88).  The space frames of all 370,000 Fieros were identical so you can add a fastback to any.  You'll need the fastback itself, taillights, decklid, grilles, rear wiring harness (kind of a b***h since the '84s wiring was different from the rest--just adds to the excitement) plus a multitude of smaller misc parts (trunk seal, for one).  It can be done, but it won't be cheap nor easy.  Best of luck.||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierobaby||10-14-2001||10:44 AM||||trevor,<P>if you decide to try it good luck! :-) lots of work mainly because 84's were not ment to be a GT if the sail panels go all theway back on the fiero its a ?GT (just so ya know) <P>Corinne<P>P.S. I also have an 84 what color is yours?<P>------------------<BR>:wtf: <FONT COLOR="LETTER"> AIM: Fierobaby87 :wtf:<BR>http://angelfire.com/sports/sfiero </FONT><BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||mbramble||10-14-2001||11:38 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierobaby:<BR><B>...if the sail panels go all the way back on the fiero its a ?GT (just so ya know)...<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>If the "sail panels go all the way back" it's a <B>fastback</B>, not necessarily a GT.  85 GT's were notchbacks.||||reg||1
Z||000004||rmorgandotcom||10-14-2001||11:36 PM||||<A HREF="http://www.diginostics.com/Home/Zoom88/zoom88.html" TARGET=_blank>PISA</A> has a conversion kit to convert a notchback to a fastback and keep the original decklid.  It looks kinda funny and is a little expensive.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rmorgansig.jpg">   <BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE> <BR><LI><I><FONT COLOR="blue">project - finale body on a 86 4 cylinder 5 speed</FONT></I><BR><LI><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/rmorgandotcom/" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/rmorgandotcom/</A><BR></UL>||||reg||1
